1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,515
Attention, all warehouse staff.

2
00:00:02,315 --> 00:00:05,255
This is an important notice, so please listen carefully.

3
00:00:05,995 --> 00:00:08,435
As you all know, Friday is the day of the big move.

4
00:00:09,415 --> 00:00:13,795
Packing will begin on Thursday morning, and the movers will arrive at eight o'clock Friday morning.

5
00:00:14,415 --> 00:00:18,575
We strongly advise you to remove your personal belongings no later than Wednesday night.

6
00:00:19,295 --> 00:00:22,950
If you don't, there is a good chance they will be lost or damaged in the move.

7
00:00:23,575 --> 00:00:27,175
Please arrive by seven o'clock tomorrow morning, dressed in comfortable clothes.

8
00:00:27,875 --> 00:00:37,535
I know Thursday and Friday will be long and busy days, but an excellent lunch will be provided for all of you, and there will be a special “housewarming” party on the following Monday night.
